thanks to this macro u can shoot the ball into the net by curving it thanks to the riptide weapon and destroy ur enemies :D
this was the 3rd part of the first form script btw have fun !!!
LOCKED FOREVER!!!!!!
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
